{"id":"chasseur","lemma":"chasseur","pos":"noun","rank":2303,"glosses":["a hunter","a fighter plane","a servant or attendant"],"ipa":"/ʃa.sœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/Fr-chasseur.ogg/Fr-chasseur.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"chasseurs","feminine":"chasseuse"},"formAudio":{"chasseurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-chasseurs.wav","chasseuse":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-chasseuse.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon père est chasseur.","en":"My father's a hunter.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Le chasseur a tué un renard.","en":"The hunter shot a fox.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to kill","l":"tuer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"fox"}]},{"text":"Certains étaient des fermiers, certains des chasseurs.","en":"Some were farmers, some were hunters.","words":[{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"farmer","l":"fermier"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Le chasseur a tiré sur l'oiseau.","en":"The hunter shot at the bird.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bird"}]},{"text":"Le chasseur chargea le fusil.","en":"The hunter put ammunition in the gun.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to load","l":"charger"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"rifle, gun"}]}]}